------------------------------------------------------------------------------
NAME                                     TYPE                        IS NULL 
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
I1                                       INTEGER                     
I2                                       INTEGER                     
I3                                       INTEGER                     
I4                                       INTEGER                     
I5                                       INTEGER                     
[ INDEX ]                                                       
